  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 88201f4f4f3247558c87e55aa4fb8ac4, type: 3}
  m_Name: RicePointWreck
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: HiddenHarbours.World::HiddenHarbours.World.DialogueDef
  Id: dialogue.rpt_wreck
  FirstLines:
  - A stern trawler lies on her side above the low-water mark, her bottom turned to the weather.
  - She has been here a few winters. More of her is sound than not.
  - With a yard, a crew and a long purse she could go back to sea. Not today.
  RepeatLines:
  - The wrecked trawler. Too big a job for now.
